        "note": "11 rows: THC, CO and NOx at running exhaust (101, 201, 301) and crankcase running (115, 215, 315), methane, NMHC, NMOG and TOG at running exhaust (501, 7901, 8001, 8601), and running Total Energy (9101).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecchainedto": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/rates-running/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0233_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecchainedto.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecchainedto"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "chain"
        ],
        "note": "8 rows: 115 <- 101, 215 <- 201, 315 <- 301 (CrankcaseEmissionRatio), 501 <- 101 and 7901 <- 101 (methaneTHCRatio), 8001 <- 7901 and 8601 <- 501, 8601 <- 8001 (HCSpeciation, TOG the sum of two parents). The chain is three rungs deep, THC to NMHC to NMOG to TOG, at every speed bin.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspeccounty": {
      "kind": "static",
